WEBVTT

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.580
A fire has broken out. A fire has broken out.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.510
If you are inside the building, please follow
the evacuation route and leave immediately.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:29.010
Repeat. If you are inside the building...

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.800
please follow the evacuation
route and leave immediately.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.500
"FIRE ALARM ACTIVATED"

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.970
Brother, I'm so hot!

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.850
Hang in there!
I'm going to take care of you, okay?

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.280
Feels so cool.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.540
The exit is up ahead.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.870
Can you two make it?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.130
Yeah.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.840
You're a good big brother.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.920
Now be careful
and find your way to safety.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.340
Aren't you going to run, too?

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
I am not going to run.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:24.310
This is who I am as the Magician...

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:26.440
Miyuki Shiba.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.480
This is my fate!

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.030
This is what I must do!

00:01:54.760 --> 00:02:00.520
Miyuki, I'm done testing you
and adjusting your CAD.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.640
Thank you very much, Brother.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.900
He won't look at me again today.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:14.820
I'm starting high school this spring,
but he still sees me as a child.

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.910
And here I thought that I'd grown a little.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:20.830
It's almost my--

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.410
Come to think of it...

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.540
it's almost your birthday, Miyuki.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.420
Th-Then, you remember?

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:29.710
Of course I do.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:33.630
How could I forget your birthday
when you're so important to me?

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.800
Brother!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.300
Is there something you'd like as a present?

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:40.640
I would like...

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.310
anything that you give me, Brother.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.980
No, what would be the point, then?

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.820
Tell me what it is that you want, Miyuki.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:53.490
You can have anything
if it's within my power to give to you.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:55.400
Anything?

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.950
Then...

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:04.000
please spend the whole day with me!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.700
MARCH 25, 2095

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.210
What a lovely day!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.970
It's like the weather's
celebrating your birthday, too.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.560
Again, Happy Birthday, Miyuki.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.770
Just like I promised,
I'm spending the whole day with you.

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:26.190
Thank you very much!

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.560
Is there someplace you'd like to go?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.230
Anywhere is fine
as long as I'm with you.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.830
What's wrong?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.420
N-Nothing at all! I'm sorry!

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:52.630
Are you okay?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.630
Yes.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.170
Just in case...

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.760
why don't we hold hands?

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:04.970
That's right. After all,
we're not boyfriend and girlfriend.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.520
We're brother and sister.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.980
Right now, we're just ordinary
fifteen-year-old students.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.530
We're the same age...

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:23.280
but that's only for about another month
until my brother's birthday.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.160
To hope for anything more than this...

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.040
Would that be asking for too much?

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:33.340
Please forgive me for keeping you waiting!

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.960
Don't worry about me.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.300
Didn't I tell you? This is your day.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.430
Thank you very much.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.970
Would it be too unladylike
to show this much skin?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:48.730
But...

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.020
I would so love to show my brother!

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.570
What do you think, Brother?

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.110
Miyuki...

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.160
Not that it doesn't become you...

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.120
but this isn't the place
to put it on full display.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.580
P-Please excuse me!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.710
I certainly embarrassed
myself in front of him.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:20.380
I suppose I deserved it for trying
to draw his attention. Such wicked thoughts!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.090
Thank you for waiting!

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.180
Wow!

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:28.640
This is the special
birthday dessert you ordered.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.230
Happy Birthday!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.770
Brother...

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:35.270
This place is renowned for the
look and taste of what it serves.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.270
So, I ordered that ahead of time.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.320
You did that for me?

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:41.950
Now then, let me try it.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.830
Delicious!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.200
It's so delicious!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.330
I'm glad you like it.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.750
That smile of yours is my ultimate reward.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:06:00.090
My brother's always thinking about me.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:04.220
To think that I can be
with such a wonderful person...

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:07.260
Thank you very much, Brother.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:09.140
Hey, that looks nice!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.350
Wanna eat here?

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:15.190
Boss, the place is really packed
today for some reason.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.900
You're right.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.950
Oh, so that's what this is about, huh?

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.780
Go serve those guests there you-know-what.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:27.740
Huh?

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:32.040
Just give them any reason you can make up.
Keep them at that table for a while.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.500
Understood!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.630
Excuse me.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.670
This is our special Lovers' Parfait.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.510
"L-Lovers"?

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.180
We didn't order this.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.390
It's a special treat, on the house.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.850
We thought you should have it,
since you two look so cute together.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.930
Which is why we're serving it to you!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:57.600
If you could use this spoon
to feed each other...

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.020
"Cute together"?

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:57.600
Meaning that my brother and I
look like lovers?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.570
and deepen your bond as lovers...

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.570
Uh, no. We're actually--

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:04.400
U-Um!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:10.240
W-Well, you see, they were kind enough
to serve it to us. Would it be wrong to indulge?

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:18.080
Right. If you say so, Miyuki.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.750
All right, Miyuki, open your mouth.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:24.470
To think that my brother
would do such a thing for me...

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:27.930
Such a wonderful thing to happen!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.430
It's delicious!

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.560
You have some cream on your mouth.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.020
I'm just kidding.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.980
Really! How could you, Brother?

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:39.560
E-Excuse me!
Can you bring us the same thing?

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:40.890
I'd like to try it, too!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.320
A Lovers' Parfait for us, too!

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:44.110
Thank you so much.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:46.950
Thank you for the lovely present!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.240
No, that was just us
having a meal together.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.700
I have another present in mind...

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.790
but if there's something you'd like,
don't be shy. Tell me.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:58.580
Something I want?

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.550
Is something wrong?

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.350
Miyuki...

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.020
Miyuki...

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.020
Would you mind stopping by this shop?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.530
Huh?

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.320
So humiliating.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.830
What an indecent delusion that was.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.290
Miyuki!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.460
What's this?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.540
Would you mind putting it on for me?

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:55.260
How beautiful!
You'd think it was made just for you!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.600
What do you think?

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.730
Well, there's a mirror over there--

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:00.690
That won't be necessary.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.440
All that I need is your opinion, Brother.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.570
It looks great on you, Miyuki.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:11.280
Then, would it be all right
if I asked you to buy this for me?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:15.370
Of course.
I more or less picked it out myself.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.040
But are you sure about that?

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.750
This is what I want.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:23.000
Because you chose it for me, Brother.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.540
Is that right?

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.880
Getting to spend time with my brother

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.670
and having all these lovely
things happen to me...

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:34.300
This is the best day of my life!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:42.850
Oh, by the way, Brother,
why did this hair ornament catch your eye?

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.690
Well, I thought...

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.480
it was made well in terms of Magic Geometry.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:51.650
It might've been made by a renowned magician.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.530
Do you really think so?

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.660
I'm not really sensing
any magical power from it.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:01.000
I'd never let you wear
anything so dangerous.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:05.630
Magic isn't that easy to wield.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.420
I agree.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.380
What's the matter?

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.180
It's the head family.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.810
The Yotsubas?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.520
I'll burn you to the ground!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:32.610
All you miserable people
who looked down on me!

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:46.750
I'm being summoned to the Kanto Branch
of the Magicians' Association.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.210
Why today of all days?

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:52.550
Well, the Association is in the same building.

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:57.050
I'll be all right. Please don't worry
about me. Just go ahead.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.220
Sorry.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.230
I'll be right back. Wait for me inside.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.480
All right.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.440
I'll be waiting for you.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:19.280
My brother was summoned by Maya Yotsuba,
head of the Yotsubas of the Ten Master Clans.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.990
Our aunt.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.830
As long as one is a member
of the Ten Master Clans, you cannot refuse.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.380
But to use my brother as if he were a pawn...

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.340
Master Tatsuya...

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.340
Forgive me for summoning
you without warning.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.340
Mr. Hayama.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.350
It's been a long time.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:46.190
But why would my aunt's head butler
be called on for such a trivial matter?

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:51.520
This particular job involves
a political hassle, you see.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:57.780
I've been dispatched to clean up
after you've completed your task.

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.660
A political hassle that requires cleaning up?

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.200
In other words, the SDF?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.410
The target is a magician
that's been modified, no...

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.830
A magician that's undergone
reinforced experiments?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.130
Take a look at this.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.380
They're being extra careful
if they're using hard copies.

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:17.290
"SEX: MALE"
"DATE OF BIRTH: 02/15/2048 (47 YEARS OLD)"
"PLACE OF BIRTH: HACHIOJI, TOKYO"

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.550
Oscillation-type...

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:23.470
A magician whose Heat aptitude
was reinforced?

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.810
Although he underwent
reinforcements at fifteen,

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:32.060
because his skills were specialized for battle,
he was more or less left to languish.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:36.940
This went on for more than 30 years,
and it seems that he's finally snapped.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:40.660
An experiment that fell short
of becoming a hero...

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:43.740
So? Where did the target escape to?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.080
I didn't see any action predictions in his file.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:49.120
He's here today.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.330
What did you say?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.920
Apparently, the man in question sought payback

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:57.010
from the Magicians' Association
for ruining his life.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:13:00.550
We anticipate that he will do
some saber-rattling this afternoon

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.600
somewhere here in Bay Hills Tower.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.560
Master Tatsuya?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:10.350
Saber-rattling here?
You've got to be kidding me!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.060
Miyuki!

